  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/68FlS3RJ/images/c069661794501249ac9ac30086c6262b3f231dfb.png\" alt=\"KonoSuba SS 1\"></p>\n<h1>概述</h1>\n<p><strong>KonoSuba: God's Blessing on This Wonderful World</strong> 是一款基于奇幻/冒险主题的整合包。这个整合包充满了魔法、怪物、地牢、行走的 NPC 等等……从爆炸的高峰到深海怪兽的深处，跳进 Minecraft 版的 KonoSuba 世界吧。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/konosuba\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmodpack%252fkonosuba\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fkesselot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/donate/kofi-plural-alt_vector.svg\" alt=\"kofi-plural-alt\"></a></p>\n<h1>特色</h1>\n<ul>\n<li>[✔️] <strong>增强型世界生成</strong> - 从神秘之树到魔法森林，探索大地的馈赠。</li>\n<li>[✔️] <strong>魔法与更多</strong> - 没有魔法就不叫 Minecraft，从爆炸法术到重力法术，一位绯红恶魔的生活在等待着你。</li>\n<li>[✔️] <strong>食物与农业</strong> - 没有什么比美食更能体现美好生活了，从节日般的寒冬到酷热的夏季，全年种植你的作物。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>截图 - 查看画廊以获取更多！</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/68FlS3RJ/images/5377939c8e432e1866605b42e6116b83d7e1eb83_350.webp\" alt=\"KonoSuba SS 2\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/68FlS3RJ/images/445e4529e9eac4bb0014c837328b9aeb5181db30_350.webp\" alt=\"KonoSuba SS 3\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/68FlS3RJ/images/b1ad15d195f2caed7496268633cc896dfcb6136b.png\" alt=\"KonoSuba SS 4\"></p>\n<h2><a href=\"https://discord.gg/N8tUm6N4Qc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">整合包 Discord</a></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftinyurl.com%252famy67484\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/39e1d151-f787-4346-9014-f14dc996f94e.webp\" alt=\"Banner Bisecthosting\"></a></p>\n<h3>整合包说明</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>如果您是 YouTube 博主或内容创作者并游玩此整合包，请在描述中放置一个指向本页面的链接，以便人们知道您正在使用的整合包。</strong></li>\n<li><strong>不允许在 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 上重新上传此整合包或任何修改版本，这包括再分发到其他任何网站。</strong> (<em>除非获得我的明确许可</em>)</li>\n</ul>",
